(text "Alinx ACVU13P SoM carrier (bom item 16): eight Samtec ADM6-60-01.5-L-4-2-A-TR (240-pin, 4 x 60, 0.635 mm) - J1/J6 on the FPGA sheet, the other six here. J3/J4/J7/J8 carry only MGT quads (unused - every signal pin no-connect, all GND pins tied). J2 = +12 V module feed (52 pins) + SelectMAP (unused) + BOOT_M straps. J5 = bank 67 (cascode_r[0..31] -> DATRnn), VCCIO_66/67/68 (tied to V18 like every VCCIO: an unpowered bank is not allowed), SYSMON VP/VN to GND. Connector X/Y positions and the Samtec footprint are the layout blocker (Alinx drawing requested)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c669dbbf-9290-4560-877b-17e3be6e2519"))
