(text "+12 V SoM feed (bom 17(d): 12 V switcher + heavy filter -> SoM only; planning figure 15 A / 180 W, user 2026-10-10). Board-to-board entry is Conn1/J506 SEAF: 30 V12SOM contacts (C2:C11, D2:D11, E2:E11) with a GND perimeter; separate J507/J508 terminals are removed. 2 x 220 uF polymer + 4 x 10 uF X7R kept here at J2 (the SoM connector end of the feed)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 455.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e62d7c8f-566d-4cef-a943-6f17fe44207d"))
